Subject: [PATCH 1493/3799] soh: rename func_80A5673C ->
 EnHeishi4_DyingGuardIdle

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the dying market guard's idle: he despawns once the Master Sword has been pulled, plays his collapse animation and cutscene line the first time, and afterwards only offers his silent line.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Heishi4/z_en_heishi4.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
